		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"/organize 队伍名称可组建队伍。\\n/leave可退出队伍。\n\t\t\t\t组建队伍并成为队长时，右击角色选择“邀请加入组队”，\n\t\t\t\t或输入/invite 角色名\n\t\t\t\t可邀请玩家加入队伍。\\n输入/expel 角色名\n\t\t\t\t可踢出^3b488c自己为队长的队伍中^000000的队员。\\n^ff0000※不会询问(Y/N)，因此需要自己慎重考虑后进行操作哦。^000000\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>社交: 队伍<INFO>22</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t\\n<TIPBOX>查看目录<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>",
			"If you form a party and become a party leader, you can right-click other characters and select 'Invite to Party' menu or invite them to the party with /invite [Character Name].\nIf you want to expel a party member, ^000000where you are the leader^3b488c with /expel [Character Name].\n^ff0000(Y/N) is not asked, so choose carefully.^000000\n?<TIPBOX>Chat: Party<INFO>22</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Adventure Agency<INFO>70</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Other Settings and Gameplay Commands<INFO>166</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
