		Page = {
			"Combat may not be possible during the Clothing Transformation effect. In this case, you can use the /return, /changedress or /nocosplay commands to cancel the effect.\n\nAlso, if it is difficult to remember the commands, you can cancel the Clothing Transformation effect through a simple conversation with Prontera's ?<NAVI>[Clothing Effect Removal]<INFO>prontera,80,106,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> NPC.\n\n?<TIPBOX>Other Settings and Gameplay Commands<INFO>166</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
