		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"?Marriage Restrictions\n?Married person\n?Baby\n?Base Level below 45\n?Partially independent baby\n\n?Wedding Preparations\nMan:\n?1x ^i[6026] <ITEM>Written Oath of Marriage<INFO>6026</INFO></ITEM>,\n?1x ^i[7170] <ITEM>Tuxedo<INFO>7170</INFO></ITEM>, 1x ^i[2613] <ITEM>Diamond Ring<INFO>2613</INFO></ITEM>\nWoman:\n?1x ^i[6026] <ITEM>Written Oath of Marriage<INFO>6026</INFO></ITEM>,\n?1x ^i[2338] <ITEM>Wedding Dress<INFO>2338</INFO></ITEM>, 1x ^i[2613] <ITEM>Diamond Ring<INFO>2613</INFO></ITEM>\n?Where to purchase\n?<NAVI>[Cognitive and Semi-Engraving]<INFO>prt_in,282,167,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<NAVI>[Marriage Goods Merchant]<INFO>prt_in,282,169,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Places where you can get married\n?<NAVI>[Prontera Cathedral]<INFO>prt_church,97,100,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?Human+Human marriage is possible\n?<NAVI>[Lasagna Wedding Hall]<INFO>lasagna,335,248,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?Doram+Doram/ Doram+Human/Human+Human marriage possible\n\n?Other\n?Tuxedo and Wedding Dress for 1 hour after marriage (unable to fight)\n?Spouse's name can be engraved on the wedding ring\n?Engraving Location:<NAVI>[Cognitive and Semi-Engraving]<INFO>prt_in,282,167,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Wedding Ring Skill\n?I'll save you\n?Recover spouse's HP\n?I'll sacrifice myself for you\n?Recover your spouse's SP\n?I miss you\n?Summon your spouse to your side\n\n?<TIPBOX>Apoption<INFO>125</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Divorce<INFO>124</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
