			"Conversation with members of guild alliances can be done with # or CapsLock+ENTER.\nAlso, if you press ^3b488cBlue Circle^000000 on the right side of chat window, you can set ^3b488creceiving group^000000.\nYou can form an alliance with up to 3 guilds.\n?<TIPBOX>Chat: Guild<INFO>23</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Guild System<INFO>30</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
