			"Knights (Lord Knights) and Crusaders (Paladins) who have learned Riding skills can ride Peco Peco.\nKnights and Crusaders can rent a Peco Peco at any time through the Peco Peco Breeder and a small amount of Zeny is consumed when renting one.\n\n\'Peco Peco Breeder\' can be found through the \'Guide\' NPC in each city.\nFor Prontera, it is as follows.\nKnights: ?<NAVI>[Peco Peco Breeder]<INFO>prontera,58,349,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\nCrusaders : ?<NAVI>[Peco Peco Breeder]<INFO>prontera,232,318,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Riding Creature Master<INFO>2001</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
