			"The Snake God's Warmth to the snake's nest, the hideout of the Rgan, located deep within the Frozen Scale Glacier. The deeper you go, the more you can meet higher-level Rgan.\n\n?^663399Entry Conditions^000000\n^FF0000Zeny, items, levels, or prerequisite quests are required to enter some areas within the dungeon.^000000\n\n?^663399Dungeon List^000000\n?<NAVI>[Snake God's Warmth F1]<INFO>jor_dun01,0,0,0,-222,1</INFO></NAVI>\n?<NAVI>[Snake God's Warmth F2]<INFO>jor_dun02,0,0,0,-222,1</INFO></NAVI>\n?<NAVI>[Snake's Nest]<INFO>jor_nest,0,0,0,-222,1</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?^663399Memorial Dungeon^000000\n?<TIPBOX>MD Simulation Juncea(200)<INFO>4297</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Aircraft Destruction Operation(200)<INFO>4298</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>To the dungeon page<INFO>6150</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
