		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"It is said that the space-time dragon Oscar discovered a new dimension rift related to the Old Glast Heim while examining the tainted dimension in Glastheim. However, unlike in the past, there is no one who should be there, so it is said that the wave can have a big impact on the present time. Looks like we'll have to find the space-time dragon Oscar and the old Glast Heim once again.\n\n?Dungeon Configuration\n?Repeatable every 3 days\n?Time Limit: 60 minutes\n?Level 170 or higher\n?<NAVI>[Oscar]<INFO>glast_01,143,288,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Dungeon Raid Loot\n?<ITEM>[Temporal Crystal]<INFO>6607</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Contaminated Magic]<INFO>6755</INFO></ITEM>\n\n?Equipment Exchange\nYou can exchange <ITEM>[Temporal Crystal]<INFO>6607</INFO></ITEM> for <ITEM>[Temporal Boots]<INFO>2499</INFO></ITEM>\nYou can also upgrade <ITEM>[Temporal Boots]<INFO>2499</INFO></ITEM> with <ITEM>[Temporal Crystal]<INFO>6607</INFO></ITEM>\n?<NAVI>[Hugin's Butler]<INFO>glast_01,210,274,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Card Exchange\nBring either <ITEM>[Coagulated Spell]<INFO>6608</INFO></ITEM> or <ITEM>[Contaminated Magic]<INFO>6755</INFO></ITEM> to exchange them for either <ITEM>[White Knight Card]<INFO>4608</INFO></ITEM> or <ITEM>[Khalitzburg Knight Card]<INFO>4609</INFO></ITEM>respectively\n?<NAVI>[Portrait Collector]<INFO>glast_01,216,292,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Enchantment\n?<ITEM>[Coagulated Spell]<INFO>6608</INFO></ITEM> can be used to enchant upgraded Temporal Boots of any type\n?<NAVI>[Hugin's Magician]<INFO>glast_01,212,273,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?Socket Activation\n?<ITEM>[Temporal Crystal]<INFO>6607</INFO></ITEM> can be used to activate a socket for upgraded Temporal Boots of any type\n?<NAVI>[Hugin's Craftsman]<INFO>glast_01,210,270,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>7102</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
	[7107] = {
		Title = "Episode/Chapter MD#MD Episode Memorial Dungeon",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"Now, the story of all of us living in the present. All stories on the continent of Midgard and beyond:\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 14.1<INFO>6041</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Hazy Forest Labyrinth<INFO>7108</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 14.3<INFO>6082</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Bios Island (160)<INFO>7109</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Morse's Cave (160)<INFO>7110</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Temple of the Demon God (160)<INFO>7111</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 15.2<INFO>10013</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Central Laboratory (135)<INFO>7112</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Last Room (150)<INFO>7113</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 16.1<INFO>8118</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Ritual of Blessing (100)<INFO>7114</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Room of Consciousness (100)<INFO>7115</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Air Fortress Invasion (140)<INFO>7116</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 16.2<INFO>8143</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Heart Hunter War Base (100)<INFO>7117</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Central Room (100)<INFO>7118</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 17.1<INFO>7055</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Regenschirm Recapture Operation (110)<INFO>7119</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Blocked OS (110)<INFO>7120</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD OS Conquest Operation (110)<INFO>7121</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD OS 2nd Search (110)<INFO>7122</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Cor Memorial (110)<INFO>7123</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Episode 17.2<INFO>7068</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Twilight Garden (130)<INFO>7124</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Hey! Sweetie (130)<INFO>7125</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD The Forgotten Kennel (130)<INFO>7126</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Hidden Flower Garden (130)<INFO>7127</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Water Garden (130)<INFO>7128</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>EPISODE 19<INFO>4257</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Simulation Juncea (200)<INFO>4297</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Aircraft Destruction Operation (200)<INFO>4298</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>EPISODE 20<INFO>4328</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Sticky Sea (215)<INFO>4360</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Neutralize the Immortal (215)<INFO>4361</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>EPISODE 21<INFO>4367</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Memory Fragment of the Old Walter (230)<INFO>4397</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Final Battle (230)<INFO>4398</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Chapter 1<INFO>4415</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>MD Reproduced Dark Whisper (200,265)<INFO>4447</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>7083</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
