		Page = {
			"The advance has secured OS' railroad route, but it's not perfect.\nPrepare for Illusion's counterattack and help the annihilation battle to take complete control of OS.\n\n?Prerequisites:\n?<TIPBOX>Old Memories<INFO>7059</INFO></TIPBOX> completed\n\n?Dungeon Configuration\n?One-Time Scenario Mode\n?Time Limit: 60 minutes\n?Level 110 or higher\n?<NAVI>[Erst]<INFO>sp_cor,163,56,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>7107</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
