			"You will have to wait the night to meet the Heart Hunters and Illusions who roam around avoiding the watchful eye. Grab your tracker and let's start a suspenseful night walk.\n\n?Prerequisites:\n?<TIPBOX>Pest Control Operation<INFO>7073</INFO></TIPBOX> Progress\n\n?Dungeon Configuration\n?One-Time Scenario Mode\n?Time Limit: 60 minutes\n?Level 130 or higher\n?<NAVI>[Erst]<INFO>ba_in01,51,157,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>7107</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
