	[8048] = {
		Title = "Diary",
		Search = 0,
		Image = "蜡历牢磐其捞胶\\item\\弊赤狼付澜",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 200 },
		Page = {
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\I am satisfied with my married life with Cain, but the road of a housewife is still too difficult for me. you can do it. Keep it up!",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nI fell asleep while preparing dinner and burned the food. Ah, why am I acting like this! Only then will I become the hated bride!",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nI had a child, Cain and my child. My heart is intersected with a bit of anxiety and a bit of ecstasy. With her chubby face, Cain says she will become her father, and she smiles. When she thinks about the future, she is a little scared, but seeing Cain makes me happy too.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nCain's nerves are getting sharper little by little. After a factory was built in the neighboring village, young men in the village are quitting their jobs as miners. He takes great pride in his work and seems to be deeply wounded.\n\n?I want to comfort him when he is depressed, but I don't know how to comfort him. It is very painful for him to be unable to be of strength to him at a time like this.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nA child was born. She is a really pretty daughter. Her name is ^339999Tarsha^000000. Her eyes resemble Cain, and she is very pretty. My child ^339999Tarsha^000000! I want to be a really good mother for this child.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nTarsha called me \'Mom\'! This is truly such a miraculous happiness. If this child grows up well and healthy, I don't think I can ask for anything more.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nCain had an accident. It seems that toxic gas came out while digging for minerals. There was no major damage, but the gas left his right arm paralyzed and Cain could no longer go to the mines.\n\nHe is drenched in great sorrow. When I prepared a hot soup for him, Cain smiled thanks and emptied the soup, but the shadow of sadness on his face did not go away.\n\nAs much as he loved his job so much, he seems to be very frustrated. Tomorrow I have to show off my cooking skills for Cain. I hope he gets stronger.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nThe days when Cain came back drunk were increasing. Injections are getting worse. His heart was so filled with a dark energy that he could no longer sympathize with him.\n\nLike a hungry wild wolf, he is ferocious and ferocious. I'm afraid of him.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nTarsha was playing around in the kitchen and burned her hand in hot water. Her treatment was successfully completed, but only a few of Tarsha's hands were left with ^ 339999 burn scars ^ 000000.\nTarsha plays with her doll as if she ever did, and she gasps, but somehow I cry.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nCain doesn't even come into the house anymore. The money he had earned was running out, and he started working in a shop in the village.\nIt's really hard and difficult to do housework and shop work at the same time, but looking at Tarsha's flawless smile, I'm getting stronger. I'm worried that Cain might go somewhere and cause another accident.",
			"^666666..........I turned a few pages.^000000",
			"^339999Month X Day X^000000\n\nApparently, my body is getting weaker. I want to talk to Cain, but his feelings are so uncomfortable that I can't speak.\nTarsha also cried more often. Oh my poor baby. He is happy to see his father whom he does not see often, but his reaction is so cold. Sometimes, though, he makes Tarsha smile.\nAt night when they drink alcohol, they always look wild and look at us as if they are menacing. Will my body be able to bear it well before his sorrow ends...",
			"^666666..........After this, there are only a blank sheets of paper.^000000"
		}
	},
