			"You can listen to Fisleak's request and talk about the research, who is devoted to researching the crafting of elemental potions.\n?^663399Required Item: Elemental Potion Creation Guide^000000\n ^663399Valid Job: Alchemist, Creator^000000\n?<NAVI>[Pisruik]<INFO>yuno_in04,33,108,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>9015</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
