	},
	[9083] = {
		Title = "Ranking: Blacksmith",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"Blacksmith Ranker Perks:\n1st~5th place: 5 Random Options are given to manufactured level 3~4 weapons\n6th-10th place: 4 Random Options are given to manufactured level 3~4 weapons\n(For Blacksmiths who are not included in the ranking, 3 Random Options are given to level 3~4 weapons.)\n\n^3b488cHow to earn Ranking Points^000000\n1 Point: Refine your self created Level 1 Weapon to +10.\n10 Points: Successfully craft a Level 3 Weapon using 3 additional materials.\n25 Points: Refine your self created Level 2 Weapon to +10.\n1000 Points: Refine your self created Level 3 Weapon to +10.\n\nBlacksmith Ranking: /blacksmith\n\n?<TIPBOX>Ranking System<INFO>9082</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
	[9084] = {
		Title = "Ranking: Alchemist",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"Alchemist Ranker Perks:\nThe recovery amount of potions made by rankers (1st to 10th place) is increased by 50%.\n\n^3b488cHow to earn Ranking Points^000000\n1 Point: Successfully make Slim Potions 3 times in a row\n3 Points: Successfully make Slim Potions 5 times in a row\n10 Points: Successfully make Slim Potions 7 times in a row\n50 Points: Successfully make Slim Potions 10 times in a row\n\nAlchemist Ranking: /alchemist\n\n?<TIPBOX>Ranking System<INFO>9082</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
	[9085] = {
		Title = "幻影",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"既是现实也是现存的地方，但不是这里。这里可以看到那处，但那处却看不到这里的异世界就叫做幻影。\n\t\t\t\t幻影大部分在掉落率和经验值上没有等级区分，而是存在<ITEM>[幻影石]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>的异世界之地。\n\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：月夜猫的噩梦<INFO>9086</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：吸血鬼幻影<INFO>9087</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：极冻幻影<INFO>9088</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：旧良宫幻影<INFO>9089</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：泰迪熊<INFO>9090</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：北边洞穴卢安达<INFO>9091</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：迷宫幻影<INFO>9092</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：深渊海底洞穴<INFO>9093</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影：孪生幻影<INFO>9157</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n\t\t\t\t◆有关幻影调查团\n\t\t\t\t专门调查幻影的幻影调查团欢迎各位想要探险的人。\n\t\t\t\t在普隆德拉的幻影调查团团长 <NAVI>[约尔]<INFO>prt_in,136,34,</INFO></NAVI>处申请加入，就可以在各幻影地图内进行每日讨伐任务。\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>幻影调查团<INFO>9126</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>回上一页<INFO>4100</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\t\t\t\t<TIPBOX>查看目录<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
	[9086] = {
		Title = "Illusion of Moonlight",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"It seems that something went wrong during the purification rituals performed regularly in Payon.\nThe elders who want to send in adventurers to solve the problem. And, getting caught up in all this, you have to investigate the nightmare of Moonlight in the abandoned village or somewhere other than the abandoned village.\n\n?^663399Level 100 or higher^000000\n?<NAVI>[Payon Elder Saniul]<INFO>payon,164,229,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\nIllusion Investigation Team Subjugation Quest\n?<TIPBOX>Q Illusion of Moonlight 100 Kills (100)<INFO>9127</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\nDaily quests that can be performed after completing the quest\n?<TIPBOX>Q Stop the Wizard! (100)<INFO>9094</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q No Mercy for Illusions! (100)<INFO>9095</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Remembering My Ancestors! (100)<INFO>9096</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\nSome equipment items can be exchanged for better performance by using items such as <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM> acquired during Illusion of Moonlight as materials.\nThe equipment to be exchanged must be refined to +9 or higher, and the Enchantments of the equipment and Cards will disappear.\n?^663399Exchange Location^000000\n?<NAVI>[Gemcutter]<INFO>pay_d03_i,160,45,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Staff of Bordeaux<INFO>26109</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Staff of Bordeaux]<INFO>1648</INFO></ITEM>, 30x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Dream Fragment]<INFO>25256</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Long Mace[2]]<INFO>16063</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Long Mace]<INFO>1525</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 20x <ITEM>[Hazy Dream Fragment]<INFO>25256</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Moonlight Sword[1]]<INFO>28725</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Moonlight Sword]<INFO>1234</INFO></ITEM>, 60x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Dream Fragment]<INFO>25256</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Spectral Spear[1]]<INFO>26007</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Spectral Spear]<INFO>1477</INFO></ITEM>, 20x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Dream Fragment]<INFO>25256</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Nurse Cap[1]]<INFO>19209</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Nurse Cap]<INFO>2277</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Bloody Love Letter]<INFO>25257</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Apple of Archer[1]]<INFO>19210</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Apple of Archer]<INFO>2285</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Broken Arrow]<INFO>25258</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Muffler[1]]<INFO>20838</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Muffler[1]]<INFO>2504</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Moon Pastry]<INFO>23228</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Shoes[1]]<INFO>22133</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Shoes[1]]<INFO>2404</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Moon Pastry]<INFO>23228</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Puente Robe[1]]<INFO>15195</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Puente Robe[1]]<INFO>15012</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Hazy Dream Fragment]<INFO>25256</INFO></ITEM>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>9085</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
	},
	[9087] = {
		Title = "Illusion of Vampire",
		Search = 1,
		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"In one corner of the Geffen underground dungeon, there is a priest and a wizard fighting each other.\nThe priests and wizards gathered to give rest to the dead, but it was discovered that a note obtained during the work had the memory of the owner of the note, that is, the power to pass into this space...?\n\n?^663399Level 130 or higher^000000\n?<NAVI>[Grimm]<INFO>gef_dun01,132,223,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\nIllusion Investigation Team Subjugation Quest\n?<TIPBOX>Q Illusion of Vampire 100 Kills (130)<INFO>9128</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\nDaily quests that can be performed after completing the quest\n?<TIPBOX>Q Curious by Nature (130)<INFO>9097</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Send the Dead Back to Earth (130)<INFO>9098</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Sweet Dreams (130)<INFO>9099</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Unreliable Fake Blood (130)<INFO>9100</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Noisy Neighbors (130)<INFO>9101</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>Q Moulding (130)<INFO>9102</INFO></TIPBOX>\n\nSome equipment items can be exchanged for better performance by using items such as <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM> acquired during Illusion of Vampire as materials.\nThe equipment to be exchanged must be refined to +9 or higher, and the Enchantments of the equipment and Cards will disappear.\n?^663399Exchange Location^000000\n?<NAVI>[Great Merchant]<INFO>gef_dun01,139,228,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Infiltrator[2]]<INFO>28022</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Infiltrator[1]]<INFO>1266</INFO></ITEM>, 80x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 20x <ITEM>[Torn Paper]<INFO>25261</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Sharpened Leg Bone of Ghoul<INFO>28023</INFO></ITEM>\n+9?<ITEM>[Sharpened Leg Bone of Ghoul<INFO>1260</INFO></ITEM>, 10x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271</INFO></ITEM>, 100x <ITEM>[Cluster of Nightmares]<INFO>25264</INFO></ITEM>\n?<ITEM>[Illusion Wizardry Staff[2]]<INFO>2039</INFO></ITEM>\n?+9 <ITEM>[Wizardry Staff]<INFO>1473</INFO></ITEM>, 40x <ITEM>[Illusion Stone]<INFO>25271