		Image = "",
		Imgcoord = { Position = 5, Size = 100 },
		Page = {
			"You can combine the following unique hats in Morroc.\n\n?<NAVI>[Trainee]<INFO>morocc_in,137,102,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> Combination List\nHe can also change the color of any <ITEM>[Cute Ribbon]<INFO>2250</INFO></ITEM> by using the dye you want it to be.\n?<ITEM>[Cute White Ribbon]<INFO>5441</INFO></ITEM>\nEither 1x Cute Ribbon, Cute Red Ribbon, Cute Blue Ribbon or Cute Green Ribbon and White Dyestuffs\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Cute Red Ribbon]<INFO>5439</INFO></ITEM>\nEither 1x of Cute Ribbon, Cute White Ribbon, Cute Blue Ribbon or Cute Green Ribbon and Scarlet Dyestuffs\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Cute Blue Ribbon]<INFO>5440</INFO></ITEM>\nEither 1x of Cute Ribbon, Cute White Ribbon, Cute Red Ribbon or Cute Green Ribbon and Cobaltblue Dyestuffs\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Cute Green Ribbon]<INFO>5438</INFO></ITEM>\nEither 1x of Cute Ribbon, Cute White Ribbon, Cute Red Ribbon or Cute Blue Ribbon and Darkgreen Dyestuffs\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Cute Ribbon]<INFO>2250</INFO></ITEM>\nEither 1x of Cute White Ribbon, Cute Red Ribbon, Cute Blue Ribbon or Cute Green Ribbon and Lemon Dyestuffs\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<NAVI>[Stair]<INFO>morocc,152,167,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> Combination List\n?<ITEM>[Stop Post]<INFO>2272</INFO></ITEM>\n50x Trunk, 1x Black Dyestuffs and 91100 Zeny\n\n?<NAVI>[Alchemist]<INFO>morocc,169,168,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> Combination List\n?<ITEM>[Binoculars]<INFO>2296</INFO></ITEM>\n1x Geek Glasses, 100x Steel and 50000 Zeny\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<NAVI>[Educated Traveler]<INFO>morocc,273,79,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> Combination List\n?<ITEM>[Drooping Cat]<INFO>5058</INFO></ITEM>\n1x Circlet[1],1x Black Dyestuffs, 300x Black Cat Doll and 1 Claw of Desert Wolf\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Smokie Leaf]<INFO>5064</INFO></ITEM>\n600x Racoon Leaf and 1x Claw of Desert Wolf\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Lazy Smokie]<INFO>5084</INFO></ITEM>\n1000x Acorn, 100x Sea-otter Fur, 10x Racoon Leaf and 1x Claw of Desert Wolf\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n?<ITEM>[Blue Fish]<INFO>5065</INFO></ITEM>\n1x Rotten Fish, 300x Stinky Scale, 50x Sushi, 1x Fish Tail, 100x Sticky Mucus and 1x Claw of Desert Wolf\n?Can be exchanged for Costumes at: <NAVI>[Eve Patterson]<INFO>mal_in01,11,110,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI>\n\n?<TIPBOX>Back to previous Page<INFO>9167</INFO></TIPBOX>\n?<TIPBOX>View Tip List<INFO>1000</INFO></TIPBOX>"
		}
